<title>UK: TABLE-Morland H1 pretax rises 8.9 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Morland H1 pretax rises 8.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		16.4		   up 7.2 pct</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.79		   up 7.4 pct</p>
<p> Pretax		     6.57		   vs 6.04</p>
<p> Turnover		   43.86		  up 17.9 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British brewing group is Morland Plc .</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
